<Base title="About & Methodology">
  <article class="prose" style="padding-top:28px">
    <p class="kicker">About</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:44px">About The Analyst Collective</h1>
    <p>The Analyst Collective is a daily briefing on four Industrials sub-sectors: <strong>Electric Vehicles, Automobiles, General Industrials and Aerospace &amp; Defence</strong>. It is written for senior bankers and investors who want the "so what" quickly.</p>
    <h2>How each brief is produced</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Every morning an automated pipeline collects news from public sources only: company announcements, industry bodies (SIAM, FADA, Vahan), government releases (MoD, MoRTH, RBI, SEBI) and established business media.</li>
      <li>An AI model drafts short summaries in its own words, each with a "why it matters" note, and links every item to its original source.</li>
      <li>A human editor reviews the draft and approves it before anything is published.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2>What we never publish</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Confidential, non-public or mandate-related information of any kind.</li>
      <li>Buy, sell or hold views, price targets or investment recommendations.</li>
      <li>Full reproductions of copyrighted or paywalled articles.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>All content is for information and education only and is not investment advice or research. Figures are as reported by the cited sources and may be revised; verify them against primary documents before relying on them.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
